cset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/42px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/56px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Torchstalk</b> are a hazardous mushroom in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. \n\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Bulbs of volatile gas swell from the central stem of this explosive fungus.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b>In-game description</b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>A volatile mushroom, it explodes and deals <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">fire</a> damage when approached by unsuspecting creatures. Many torchstalk in an area can set off a chain reaction of explosions.\n</p><p>Destroying a Torchstalk specimen along with <b>all</b> other kinds of hazardous mushrooms in the Underdark grants an <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">inspirational</a> event <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Mushroom_Enthusiast\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mushroom Enthusiast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Mushroom_Enthusiast\" title=\"Outlander\">Mushroom Enthusiast</a> for characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/30px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/40px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Outlander\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inflicts\">Inflicts</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\" style=\"overflow:hidden\">\n<p>Explosion\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon